  "body": "## What changed\n\n#230 (from the review of PR #190): Fit to Models' cylinder took its diameter from the padded footprint's **diagonal**, so a round part of radius R got a ~1.41 R bar - and since #130 the turning kernels rough from the bar's OD, so every auto-fitted lathe setup cut many passes in air.\n\n- `camcraft_geometry::stock::fit_cylinder_about(bounds, r_max, margin)`: a cylinder about the vertical axis through the bounds' XY centre with radius `r_max + margin` (height and placement as before).\n- `camcraft_app::model::solid_world_radius_about(world, c)`: the models' largest horizontal distance from the vertical line through `c` (stock and WCS excluded, as `solid_world_aabb`) - a turned part's revolved max radius.\n- The Stock page's StockFit (cylinder) uses them. The cylinder still contains every vertex and is never larger than the old diagonal bound, so it applies to every cylinder fit, mill included.\n- Existing documents keep their stock numbers on load; only a new Fit is snugger. Decision recorded in `RECOMMENDED.md` (#230).\n\nNote: PR #238 (#198) refactors the same StockFit handler a few lines away (`apply_stock_fit`); whichever merges second takes a small merge.\n\n## Gate (own worktree build, current main)\n\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-geometry`: green.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui`: every binary green (`shell` 20/20) except the lib's `egui_shell_snapshot_light` (Diff 1) and `tool_editor_snapshot` (Diff 4) - software-GL diffs, same counts on main.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --tests`: only `drilling_axial::a_drill_where_the_model_has_no_hole_is_convicted` fails (known on main).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-geometry -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `geometry::stock::tests::a_snug_cylinder_is_the_revolved_radius_plus_the_allowance` (R 10 + 2 → Ø24, snugger than the diagonal fit)\n- `shell::a_cylinder_fit_round_a_turned_part_is_snug` (a 64-segment r10 bar through the real StockFit → Ø24 x 44)\n- `shell::cylinder_fit_keeps_the_cylinder_choice` (updated: a cube's half-diagonal + margin)\n\nChangelog: Fit to Models' cylinder stock is snug - the part's radius plus the allowance, not the footprint diagonal\n\nOutside contributor PR (fork).\n\nFixes #230\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
